# The bundled i2p router binary (i2pd[.exe]) is staged here at build time.
# CI builds it from ../../third_party/i2pd; for local dev put a copy here, or
# point GIPNY_I2P_BIN at one. tauri.conf.json bundles it via `resources/i2pd*`,
# and that glob must match at least one file or tauri-build fails the build.
# The binary itself is gitignored — only this placeholder keeps the dir present.
